      "message": "In the heap dump I have, there are 2 inflated monitors in the boot image space: the ReferenceQueue.lock object and FinalizerWatchdogDaemon.\n\nFrom dumpsys meminfo of com.android.telephony.imsmedia after boot, it looks to me like avoiding monitor deflation in the image space saves 48KB of \".Boot art\". It\u0027s not as much as the 176KB saved from the Zygote space, but it\u0027s also not nothing.",
